 * 区域限流判定：返回非 null 表示被限流。须持有发布单行锁调用，保证计数与下发一致。
 */
private PullResponse checkRegionThrottle(ReleaseOrder order, Device device) {
    var limit = regionLimitRepository.findLimit(order.id(), device.region());
    if (limit.isEmpty()) {
        return null;
    }
    long inFlight = taskRepository.countInFlightByRegion(order.id(), device.region());
    long available = limit.get() - inFlight;
    if (available <= 0) {
        return throttle(order, device);
    }
    var wait = regionWaitRepository.find(order.id(), device.deviceId());
    if (wait.isEmpty()) {
        return null; // 未曾被限流：不排队，正常参与
    }
    long ahead = regionWaitRepository.countAhead(order.id(), device.region(),
            wait.get().waitedAt(), device.deviceId());
    if (ahead >= available) {
        return throttle(order, device); // 释放的名额按等待时刻先到的设备优先
    }
    regionWaitRepository.delete(order.id(), device.deviceId());
    return null;
}

private PullResponse throttle(ReleaseOrder order, Device device) {
    LocalDateTime now = LocalDateTime.now(clock);
    regionWaitRepository.upsert(order.id(), device.deviceId(), device.region(), now);
    throttleEventRepository.append(order.id(), device.region(), device.deviceId(), now);
    return PullResponse.throttled();
}
```

Wait — one subtlety: when a waiting device is blocked by fairness (ahead >= available), we call throttle() which refreshes waited_at to now. That moves it to the back. Per spec "保留最近一次限流时刻" — the record keeps the most recent throttle time. Yes, as specified.

Another subtlety: in the fairness branch, `available` counts slots not yet occupied. The device itself is waiting; the slots will be given to the first `available` waiters in order. If ahead < available, this device is among them → gets slot. Correct.

Note: non-waiting devices can jump ahead of waiters (per spec). OK.

Also: the upsert-then-append uses the same `now`. Good.

Edge: what if device was throttled (wait record exists), then pulls again while region still at capacity → first branch (available <= 0) → throttle() refreshes waited_at. Good, "保留最近一次限流时刻".

Now update TaskService constructor and pull. Then compile.

